      "source_chain": [
        "Original _producer_exchange stores first cancellation without a sampling/cleanup boundary; it remains connected through _finish.",
        "Native Cylinder._on_exit_level\u2192Exchange.cleanup\u2192cancel_all(\"exchange_removed\")\u2192cancel\u2192_present\u2192state_changed can notify the TEST observer during normal disposal of the intentionally held final warning.",
        "Original can record a cleanup-labelled first_native_refusal after successful sampling and still report success. No native execution or exact observed cancellation is asserted by this source audit."
      ],
      "minimal_fix": "Selected v2 binds actual native Exchange, checks any remaining live refusal at final paused boundary, explicitly disconnects only this TEST observer, records that boundary and then runs unchanged native cleanup. Earlier callback data and refusal predicates remain byte-identical; no live reason is ignored."
    }
  ],
