      "result": "SOURCE_COHERENT_UNEXECUTED",
      "detail": "No separate original O1 Codec exists: canonical Cylinder local/progress validation plus shared SnapshotCodec/Actor2/Exchange1/paired Scheduler own old12. Exact key/profile/world/actor schema checks and genuine whole captures remain. Native old host/kit/Scout/Exchange pins unchanged."
    },
    {
      "subject": "genuine checkpoint/final held unit",
      "result": "SOURCE_COHERENT_UNEXECUTED",
      "detail": "Actual stable CHECKPOINT_REGION contact suffices independent of journal count. Final admission requires local checkpoint flags plus actual side attempt durable checkpoint ID. The fourth declared dash approaches final source only after observing genuine committed CP; held warning is captured by public deferred Pause retaining the same earlier CP. If native movement/proof/view refuses, retain incomplete."
    },
    {
      "subject": "journal history scope",
      "result": "LIMIT_NOT_NEW_GATE",
      "detail": "The four nominal baseline endpoints miss west/east journal contact rectangles; before-final and held units may have zero collected journals. This is explicitly valid empty-journal-history old transport, not nonempty journal collection/completion/ended-Scheduler evidence. Do not infer it or add a full-loop requirement; reuse accepted unchanged contact/completion evidence and later focused new-goal checks at their scopes."
    },
    {
      "subject": "native Store custody",
      "result": "SOURCE_COHERENT_UNEXECUTED",
      "detail": "Supported unique user:// original Store. Exact whole/checkpoint/Story/Attempts typed strings and original var_to_bytes plus raw primary/backup/preferences/settings bytes/hash/path/size/presence retained. Original native files deliberately remain; no historical repair/transplant/schema conversion. Primary format2 payload/checksum joined to actual model. Original raw backups remain genuine prior generations, not rewritten to match current checkpoint."
    },
    {
      "subject": "normal disposal",
      "result": "SOURCE_COHERENT_WITH_V2_OBSERVER_FIX",
      "detail": "Actual Shell/free/descendant weakrefs/group checks and FPS/audio/owned observer cleanup retained. User Store retention is intentional custody, not an assertion of filesystem deletion. An early pre-Shell refusal can produce a secondary empty-ref cleanup failure in original/v2; it preserves actual first failure and does not grant a pass. No extra cleanup qualification change made in this minimal successor."
    },
    {
      "subject": "finite route and stop",
      "result": "SOURCE_COHERENT_UNEXECUTED",
